      "title": "Four domains, one import",
      "items": [
        "Every hook comes from @pixelkit-labs/sdk; only the four ML Kit hooks live behind the /mlkit subpath",
        "Pro exclusives report unsupported rather than failing on a device without a HiLight array or UWB",
        "The keystore path never returns key material to JavaScript, only the result of using it"
      ]
