      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What reaches real silicon",
      "items": [
        "CPU frequencies are read per core from cpufreq, not estimated from a model name",
        "The TPU is only reachable through AICore, so useTPU reports what AICore exposes rather than claiming the chip directly",
        "13 of the 32 hooks need no Kotlin at all and work on any Android device"
      ]
    }
